n_index":27,"source_sha256":"5184ecf09baaa30815775be896127748b89749fe17ee9c2af2496ad353ab0edc","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":13}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-10-29, caught up with Calvin (\"Hey Dave!\"): Calvin told him that since they last talked he went to a networking event to meet more artists — \"So cool!\" — and that the people he met will help him build up his fan base — \"Super excited about what it could lead to\" (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md) [S27T1]. Dave then told Calvin he's been getting into photography recently — he's \"seen some amazing places and taken some great shots\" — and offered to show Calvin them (details in the Photography section of this file) [S27T2]; Calvin: \"Yeah, show me what you got!\" [S27T3]. Dave shared two Boston photos: first, a photo of a city skyline at sunset with a clock tower — \"Look at this magnificent sunset I captured on camera. It's truly breathtaking to witness such beautiful sunsets! The sky looks like it's on fire!\" (Calvin: \"Wow, that view looks awesome! What city is it?\") [S27T4][S27T5]; second, a photo of the clock tower in the city with buildings around it, which he took last month (~September 2023) at sunset — \"got a great shot - it was stunning!\" (Calvin: \"Wow, that pic is amazing!\") [S27T6]. Calvin recognized the clock tower (\"In your last photo, is that the clock tower?\") and said he was in Boston a few years back and it's \"such a beautiful city. You're so talented, Dave!\" (Calvin's side in the Boston trip section of /memories/calvin.md) [S27T5][S27T7]. Dave confirmed it is the clock tower — he snapped it at sunset and the colors were stunning — and said photography helps him capture and appreciate the beauty of nature — \"It's been an awesome creative outlet and I'm loving it.\" (details in the Photography section of this file); Dave: \"Thanks, Calvin! Your kind words mean a lot.\" [S27T7][S27T8]. The conversation continued: Calvin asked how Dave's car project was going, and Dave said he had \"just finished restoring it and it looks amazing,\" inviting Calvin over to check it out (details in ## Classic cars), and then asked how everything was with the music (\"Any updates?\"); Calvin: he'd had some great collaborations recently and his album is almost finished, and he'll send Dave some previews soon (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md); the chat closed with the two arranging a catch-up when one of them is free — Calvin: \"Let me know when you're free for a catch-up.\" Dave: \"Cool, Calvin! Can't wait to hear it. Let me know when you're free and take it easy!\" Calvin: \"Cheers! I'll let you know when I'm free. Bye!\" [S27T9][S27T10][S27T11][S27T12][S27T13].","text_sha256":"06b00a55c3a470022c7e6f1300da3a244bdf994f37d6bedbac8e199acb84fcef","timestamp":"2023-10-29T10:49:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D30:1"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":157,"line_start":157,"source_locators":["[S30T1]"],"text_sha256":"c0276aee65470bbc39dad5021c211e729734ea923bb48f43298f2e0b3ba5e082"}],"dia_ids":["D30:1"],"evidence_id":"ev-5fbf773c347970176d896e49e806f58564191681198adc63cf829afbe2bfd005","group_id":"/memories/dave.md > # Dave","line_end":157,"line_start":157,"observation_ids":["obs-0004"],"path":"/memories/dave.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1e1b75083358ef27a98dd215a4e75c819ace6f2ee9b560ba394e0f0394","retrieval_round":5,"schema_version":1,"score":null,"section":"# Dave > ## Photography (new as of 2023-10-29)","selection_ordinal":3,"session_id":"session_30","source_kind":"curated","source_locators":["[S30T1]"],"source_map_sha256":"6e99115961bae06a48bfb7e82dbdcc18dc32ccf6c5ce57e3c266dfc7a5d4d574","source_records":[{"dia_id":"D30:1","global_turn_index":545,"locator":"[S30T1]","raw_turn_